Persemakmuran Kapuloan Mariana Lor (&lt;a href="basa%20Inggris"&gt;basa Inggris&lt;/a&gt;: Commonwealth of the Northern Mariana Islands/CNMI) iku siji &lt;a href="Persemakmuran%20%28AS%29"&gt;persemakmuran&lt;/a&gt; duwèké &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; (AS) ing &lt;a href="Samodra%20Pasifik"&gt;Samodra Pasifik&lt;/a&gt; kulon. Kapuloan iki dumadi saka 15 &lt;a href="pulo"&gt;pulo&lt;/a&gt; sing dumunung antarané &lt;a href="Hawaii"&gt;Hawaii&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt;.
